{
 "part": "script/script_0039",
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "script:0039:035E",
   "src": "b999ef3b08a1",
   "t": "<FACE:6C>Make haste!<NL><WAIT>If you don't hurry up,<NL>they'll be here!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:0381",
   "src": "ef202ff0d1f7",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Easy for you to say,<NL>it won't move-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:039C",
   "src": "68758350d912",
   "t": "<FACE:6C>How pathetic!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:03A9",
   "src": "2fb84aa7236a",
   "t": "<FACE:6C>At that rate you're no<NL>use to the Sperobos!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:03C6",
   "src": "c4e5d3dac7be",
   "t": "<FACE:6C>Use that rock to block<NL>the entrance somehow!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:03E3",
   "src": "03874b89f279",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Looks like hard work…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:03F2",
   "src": "314ae53d4e7c",
   "t": "<FACE:81>Ah! <PLAYER>-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:03FC",
   "src": "ae7e8e03760b",
   "t": "<FACE:6D>They're here already?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:040B",
   "src": "5d36b76be0ad",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>So we don't have to<NL>move it now-robo?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:0421",
   "src": "67aa6442585c",
   "t": "<FACE:6C>…Nothing for it!<WAIT><FACE:6F>Let's Robattle!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:043C",
   "src": "842035737920",
   "t": "<FACE:6D>You lot lack strength!<WAIT><FACE:81>We're sorry-robo…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:045D",
   "src": "a7977f03eed7",
   "t": "<FACE:04>What were they trying<NL>to do?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0039:046F",
   "src": "348ba7426b97",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Who cares about that?<WAIT>Let's get moving!"
  }
 ]
